To run
```
.\arduino-cli.exe compile -b arduino:avr:uno d:\Code\mycode\arduino\poll-voc-and-display
arduino-cli compile -b esp32:esp32:uPesy_wroom

.\arduino-cli.exe upload -t -p COM3 -b arduino:avr:uno d:\Code\mycode\arduino\poll-voc-and-display
arduino-cli upload -t -p COM1 -b esp32:esp32:uPesy_wroom
arduino-cli upload -t -p /dev/cu.usbserial-0001 -b esp32:esp32:uPesy_wroom

putty COM3 -serial -sercfg 9600,8,n,1,N
putty COM1 -serial -sercfg 9600,8,n,1,N
putty /dev/cu.usbserial-0001 -serial -sercfg 9600,8,n,1,N
```


** Wiring Arduino Uno R3 **
1. Wire display according to display.cpp instructions.
2. Connect Arduino 3.3v to power strip plus and ground to ground strip.
3. Connect SENSEVAL-SCB4XV1 evaluation board
    1. Connect ground to pin 13
    2. Connect power strip to pin 1
    3. Connect Arduino SCL to pin 20
    3. Connect Arduino SDA to pin 21
